                        "text": "<p>A patented magnetic insert slides inside your jacket pocket, holding the Pocket Square™ securely in place at the perfect height.</p><p><strong>Please note:</strong>&nbsp;Contains strong magnets. Keep away from pacemakers and other implanted medical devices.</p>",
